      <p class="detail__sub">One feeder, two regimes. A synthetic model of a few hundred households on one distribution feeder in an Indian city.</p>
      <p class="detail__lead">It runs the same week twice. Once as things are, where every exported unit goes to the DISCOM at a fixed ₹2.50. Once where a household can see the feeder, and sell to a neighbour.</p>
